  "query": "-- BY id, ALWAYS. Two merges naming the same pair in opposite orders would\n-- deadlock if each locked its own source first; ordering by a total order the\n-- database shares makes that impossible rather than unlikely.\nSELECT\n    id,\n    location_id,\n    row_version,\n    status\nFROM packaging\nWHERE id IN ($1, $2)\nORDER BY id ASC\nFOR UPDATE;\n",
